			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">is a proverb in the mouth of fools .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">is<crossref let="f" cid="c20026008.1" />one who gives honor to a fool .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">is a proverb in the mouth of fools .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">is one who hires a passing fool or drunkard .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">is<crossref let="i" cid="c20026011.2" />a fool who repeats his folly .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">
				<crossref let="k" cid="c20026012.2" />There is more hope for a fool than for him .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">There is a lion in the streets ! ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">so does a sluggard on his bed .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">it wears him out to bring it back to his mouth .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">
				<crossref let="n" cid="c20026016.2" />than seven men who can answer sensibly .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">is like one who takes a passing dog by the ears .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">Like a madman who throws<crossref let="o" cid="c20026018.1" />firebrands , arrows , and death</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">and says , “ I am only joking ! ”</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026020">
			</marker>
			<v n="20">and where there is no<crossref let="p" cid="c20026020.1" />whisperer ,<crossref let="q" cid="c20026020.2" />quarreling ceases .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026021">
			</marker>
			<v n="21">so is<crossref let="r" cid="c20026021.1" />a quarrelsome man for kindling strife .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026022">
			</marker>
			<v n="22">they go down into the inner parts of the body .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026023">
			</marker>
			<v n="23">are fervent lips with an evil heart .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026024">
			</marker>
			<v n="24">and harbors deceit in his heart ;</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026025">
			</marker>
			<v n="25">for there are<crossref let="w" cid="c20026025.2" />seven abominations in his heart ;</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026026">
			</marker>
			<v n="26">his wickedness will be exposed in the assembly .</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v20026027">
			</marker>
